PYSEC-2026-3457 | pyasn1 | DoS via exact big-integer exponentiation converting univ.Real (mantissa/base/exponent) to Python float. Fix requires pyasn1>=0.6.4, same python-jose version constraint blocker. Same compensating control: RSA backend never exercised, HS256-only. | 2026-10-02 | 2026-12-02
PYSEC-2026-3455 | pyasn1 | BER decoder DoS via unbounded long-form tag continuation-octet accumulation. Fix requires pyasn1>=0.6.4, same python-jose version constraint blocker. Same compensating control: RSA backend never exercised, HS256-only. | 2026-10-02 | 2026-12-02
